# --- COMMITLINT CONVENTIONS (central-mosque-bogota) ---
# Allowed <type> values (lowercase):
#   feat     - New user-facing feature, route, component, or Strapi collection
#   fix      - Bug fix (SSR, UI, i18n, RTL, API fallback, or CMS schema)
#   docs     - Documentation updates (docs/ Astro Starlight, README, CLAUDE.md)
#   style    - Formatting, Tailwind tokens, CSS logical properties (no logic change)
#   refactor - Code restructuring without changing external behavior
#   perf     - Performance optimization (caching, image optimization, bundle size)
#   test     - Adding or updating unit (Vitest), Storybook, or E2E (Playwright) tests
#   build    - Build system, Vite/Astro config, Docker, or dependency updates
#   ci       - GitHub Actions workflows, Husky hooks, or verification scripts
#   chore    - Maintenance tasks, tooling, or configuration updates
#   revert   - Reverting a previous commit
#
# Common <scope> values (lowercase):
#   frontend, backend, docs, i18n, rtl, a11y, bff, islamic-api, strapi,
#   prayer-times, ramadan, quran, hadith, khutbahs, events, bookings,
#   donations, certificates, newsletter, ui, seo, docker, deps
#
# Examples:
#   feat(prayer-times): add Hijri month calendar fallback for Bogota coordinates
#   [CMB-42] fix(rtl): replace physical left/right padding with ps/pe in Navbar
#   docs(architecture): document 4-layer Islamic API offline resilience flow
